    "text": "firstalert4.com\nwebsite\nMaryland Heights\nJob fair coming to Maryland Heights July 24\nBy First Alert 4 Staff,\n10 hours agoMARYLAND HEIGHTS, Mo. (First Alert 4) - Job seekers will have the chance to connect with dozens of employers at the Job News Job Fair on Thursday, July 24. The event will run from 10 a.m. to 2 p.m. at Orlando’s Event & Conference Center, 2050 Dorsett Village in Maryland Heights. Parking and admission are free.\n6",
